[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=RudyDesk
GenericName=Remote Desktop
Comment=See and control another computer over the internet
Comment[ru]=Видеть чужой экран и управлять им через интернет
Comment[de]=Einen anderen Computer über das Internet sehen und steuern
Comment[es]=Ver y controlar otro ordenador a través de internet
Comment[pl]=Podglądaj i kontroluj inny komputer przez internet
Exec=rudydesk %U
Icon=com.rudydesk.RudyDesk
Terminal=false
Categories=Network;RemoteAccess;
Keywords=remote;desktop;support;vnc;rdp;screen;
StartupWMClass=RudyDesk
StartupNotify=true
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/rudydesk;
